     [#D7D7AF][/dim]renderers, and the core wire.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]stitch_origin_badges.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/stitch_origin_badges.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-jo[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-jo/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Core stitch-origin classifier[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the `CommitOriginWire` enum, the footer-driven [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`classify_commit_origin` function, and the `origin` field on the VCS-log[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit wire in the linked `sase-core` repo, bump the VCS-log wire schema[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]version, and expose both through the PyO3 binding with Rust unit and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parity tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Tracked-commit provenance invariant[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]invariant[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]invariant: stamp `SASE_TYPE=stitch` on every commit created through the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked `sase stitch create` workflow, audit every remaining [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit-creating call site so each stamps a `SASE_TYPE=` value, and add a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract test that keeps new call sites from regressing the invariant.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python wire and golden-contract parity[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: mirror the new `origin` field in the Python VCS-log wire records, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]teach the pure-Python golden-contract parser to compute the same value, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and update the shared commit fixtures and core wire tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Timeline, legend, and detail rendering[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: add the shared origin glyph/label/style module, the fixed origin[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]column on timeline rows, the adaptive legend key, the Origin line in the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Stitches detail panel, and the origin field in every `sase stitch log` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output format, with unit and PNG visual coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]origin filter and CLI flag[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]filter[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]filter: add the repeatable, negatable `origin:` key to the Stitches [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filter query language with completions and canonical rendering, plus the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matching `sase stitch log --origin` flag and post-collection filtering.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, help modal, and configuration reference[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after invariant, render, filter[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document the origin taxonomy, glyphs, provenance invariant, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`origin:` filter across the ACE guide, commit-workflow guide, CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference, configuration reference, and the ACE help modal.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-jo","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-jo.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-56baf9729980c4074b6a636664c745fb","started_at":"2026-08-11T11:03:25.617734+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"20c43912889920fc70e42b8bc7af7f4119c4080bb28356f994f30c4d6b3edab9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.5/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"842b6f5aa82ea16cee299c55847abb73c635384a7dabf025b15f2d42150712b3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.5/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"cfe42bb6f6a65653b240969a0f9fb9fe2e2cdd37b1dac932ba841d9903cc7f74","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.5/prompt.md","size_bytes":148},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"1d962654bcffb1bf5474f08b13b12b4fd354612facc20e97b73099f0a74ebbbd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.5/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4113},"state":{"digest":"cac9aaae5de1791613832f7b3bf6866095fc0eaeb5d0dec68f64ea61c252e946","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.5/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.5","local_name":"sase-jo.5","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-jo","agent_clan_generation":"20260811070259","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-jo.5","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-jo","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","p